                    WeightedRandomSampler on the skin‐tone                      
                    attribute to ensure each batch during                       
                    training contains equally represented                       
                    skin tones, which should mitigate bias                      
                    and improve fair generalization. We                         
                    compute sample weights inversely                            
                    proportional to each tone’s frequency                       
                    and feed them to the DataLoader. All                        
