                    Design: We will implement simple                            
                    test-time augmentation (TTA) by                             
                    averaging predictions on original and                       
                    horizontally flipped images during                          
                    validation and in the predict()                             
                    function. For each batch in validation,                     
                    we run the model on the batch and its                       
                    horizontally flipped version, average                       
                    the predicted probabilities before                          
                    computing AUROC. The predict() function                     
                    is updated similarly to average                             
                    probabilities for each image.                               
                    Results: The training script executed                       
                    successfully without errors. The model                      
