                    Design: We’ll replace the standard                          
                    binary cross‐entropy with a binary                          
                    focal loss (γ=2, α=0.25) so the model                       
                    focuses on hard, ambiguous examples and                     
                    reduces overfitting. This only requires                     
                    swapping out the loss function, leaving                     
                    all other training components                               
                    (augmentations, backbone, scheduler,                        
                    skin‐tone embedding, etc.) unchanged.                       
