                    Design: I propose adding RandAugment to                     
                    the training data pipeline to introduce                     
                    stronger, automated augmentation and                        
                    improve generalization. Specifically,                       
                    we insert                                                   
                    torchvision.transforms.RandAugment                          
                    (with 2 operations at magnitude 9)                          
                    after the random crop and before flips,                     
